 "text": "Hi, how are things with you? Great that you' exploring the medium. Are you interested in news or crime, or something lighter like comedy or drama? Then there are few good ones for that. The Food Party is great if you love kitchens. Mysteries of the Past has fascinating historical mysteries. And if you enjoy the odd bit of crime, The Ingredient is excellent. Some do, especially if they go off topic a lot. Many podcast players let you set a cut off point too, which is useful even without an ads free version available. Then start with an episode of your favorite of the ones you like the sound of, and see where it takes you from there.",
